orld  allowing him to freeze things with his  sword or his aura and speaking of his  sword brook is the crew's second  swordsman he uses a cane sword called  soul solid and while zoro is more of a  samurai fighter brook uses a mixture of  fencing and the ido that he calls gentle  blade style his attacks tend to be much  more precise and speedy offering a lot  of power as a result beyond his  swordsmanship though brook has some  unique abilities to his skeletal body he  is so lightweight that he can run on  water kind of circumventing the weakness  to water that devil fruit users have  he's also resistant to heat cold  lightning and disease as he doesn't have  skin blood or organs he can survive  having his head cut off and he can just  heal from drinking milk when i think of  how strong brooke is in terms of the  crew i usually think of him as kind of  middle of the group somewhere just below  frankie and around usa and just like  with those characters while he  definitely offers a little bit of power  he has a secondary skill set that is  pretty invaluable and that is because  brooke is our cruise musician he  specializes in violin piano and guitar  but regardless of what he's playing he  can enchant his melodies to have effects  on those who hear them for example  making people fall asleep or hypnotizing  them into thinking that they're at some  kind of festival which if you can affect  an enemy with these things is pretty  valuable brook also has the role of  being in charge of keeping up morale on  the crew he uses music to lighten the  mood inspire or just generally cheer  people up you've probably gone in long  car rides you know how much music helps  but imagine days at sea with nothing  else to do and nothing to listen to i  would think it could be rough at times  even without the music brook's sense of  humor and larger than life personality  really help with raising the mood in  general and while not all of his jokes  might land we could probably do without  the 500th panty joke on average i'd say  the crew is extremely lucky to have him  with them and now on to our 10th and  final official crew member jinbei  was a former warlord and is now the  helmsman of the straw hats ever since on  fishman island jinbe has always kind of  felt like a character you meet in an rpg  who is way higher level than your party  but that you know you will eventually be  able to recruit and that's kind of  exactly what happens with him when luffy  meets jinbe he is a considerable  powerhouse definitely not able to take  on the admirals but even against them he  can kinda hold his own and protect  himself for the most part we even see  him taking the attack that killed ace  fairly well  not great but you know he survived we  see him standing toe to toe with moria  easily basically taking him down in one  shot and even big mom states that jinbe  leaving her crew would be a huge loss of  power for her jinbe is easily one of the  strongest fish men to appear in the  series so far even able to punch  wadatsumi into the air he's durable  enough to go through the baptizing and  impel down without flinching something  that the guards claim to be amazing  later taking a head-on sword swing from  big mom without really being damaged at  all and he's fast enough to keep up with  luffy in gear second even on land and  all of these abilities are significantly  amplified when he's underwater jinbe's  real power though comes from fishman  karate and even among fish men he is  considered a prodigy and a master having  received a black belt as a child jinbe  is so talented at fishman karate that  his punches don't even need to land  instead the water particles in the air  will react to his attack and send  enemies flying  even when we look at something like big  mom's crew we see him taking out the  officer's charlotte opera in one punch  beyond all of this his fishman karate  allows him to freely manipulate water  enabling him to throw it bend it or  shape it through his attacks even just  his water shot which is a basic  technique was miles stronger than hordy  jones's despite hordy being on energy  steroids basically jinbe is a brawler  he's a tank he's fast and he's a water  bender all of which combine to make him  quite a threat as a helmsman jinbe is  able to take advantage of his knowledge  of sea currents and general mastery of  the craft to allow him to surf the sunny  through a curling wave with frankie even  saying that jinbe would be able to bring  out sunny's full potential and the last  thing i want to mention with jinbei is  something that probably goes a bit  underappreciated and that's his ability  to speak a voice of reason jinbe is  level-headed tactful and  well-thought-out most importantly though  is his ability to translate those  thoughts and feelings towards others  especially on a diplomatic scale like he  had done with big mom or on an emotional  scale like he did with luffy after ace's  death and while characters like robin  nami zorro and to a lesser degree  frankie if he's in the mood to be  serious  might be able to do this kind of thing  as well jinbe's words seem to inherently  carry more weight to many people  worldwide luffy included now i do want  to quickly mention the two people who  literally carry the crew on their backs  as well because the mary and the sunny  are absolutely crewmates in their own  right the going mary was a caravel ship  one popular in the 15th century in our  world that offered a lot of  maneuverability and was small enough to  travel through rivers easily which are  great things but this lightweight design  also means  it's kind of fragile which we definitely  see with the mary we got the mary in  syrup village and she carried the crew  all the way to water 7 and annie's lobby  before she was finally put to rest the  merry was a very basic ship a few  cannons a lounge a room for the men and  one for the women and a storage room of  course we also saw her being given wings  going towards skypia as well but while  the mary didn't offer anything crazy  like the sunny wood it was a ship that  was loved by her crew and that loved  them back  so much so that a club outermon or ship  fairy appeared basically a sign that the  ship had been genuinely cared for we see  the cleveland appearing in both skypia  to repair the mary as well as bringing  the ship to annie's lobby to rescue the  crew and carry them one last time mary  was a simple ship but her crew was  reckless with her luffy crashed her into  icebergs zorro and sanji were stupid and  broke things all the time  but even so she was happy mary was  succeeded by the thousand sunny a ship  designed by frankie to be the greatest  ship in the world  unlike the mary which was a caraval the  sunny is a brigantine and this ship has  all the bells and whistles most  iconically is the soldier docking system  which houses compartments for the  soldiers of the sunny as frankie calls  them channel 0 has paddles on either  side of the ship allowing them to  progress even without wind or even  travel in reverse if needed channel 1  has a remodeled waiver channel 2 has the  mini mary a shopping boat channel 3 has  a submarine that looks like a shark the  shark submerged 3.  channel 4 has the black rhino channel 5  has the brachio tank and naturally  channel 6 has an inflatable pool just  like frankie himself the sunny can also  release a burst of air the coup de burst  a massive force that allows the sunny to  fly for a decent distance basically  allowing them to escape in a worst case  scenario the head of the sunny also has  some secrets as well chicken voyage sees  the mane of the lion becoming a  propeller that pushes the ship backwards  or the geon cannon which has the lion  opening its mouth and firing a massive  energy beam on the less battle oriented  side of things the sunny also has a boys  and a girls room but it also has a  kitchen a sick bay an aquarium a library  the us