uch power  behind her attacks she's extremely agile  she's honestly pretty similar to nami  before she had access to weather  abilities rather than using a bose staff  like nami did though vivi used the  peacock slashers sharp bladed discs on a  wire that spun around her fingers and  were absolutely able to decapitate  someone if needed or if an enemy was too  strong or too fast for her she could  always try to stun her opponents with a  hypnotic dance using the patterns on her  clothes or her perfume scent in the  anime like i said vivi doesn't offer  much in terms of power but her  diplomatic skills as well as her ability  to win people over are worth just as  much in the right situation especially  when we consider the events of revelry  oh and also she has a pet duck and karu  is fantastic and what more do you really  need but there you have it a quick look  at all the straw hats how they fight and  what they offer the crew on a grander  scale some are more battle oriented some  are more support oriented but each  member of the crew brings with them a  talent that is necessary for the crew's  success which roommate is your favorite  and why and out of all the crew members  which one has your favorite attack skill  or ability finally if you were to join  the crew what would you bring to the  table let me know all those in the  comments down below and of course  remember to leave a like to let us know  to keep making one piece content you can  also subscribe to the channel which is a  totally free way of supporting us and  keeps you up to date on all anime uproar  content finally you can follow us over  on twitter at anime uproar or you can  follow myself over on my own channel  axel beats for now though thank you all  so much for watching and until next time  remember to stay excellent

