jority of  luffy's attacks involve him stretching  his limbs back and slingshotting them  forward with things like the gum gum  pistol gum gum bazooka or the gum gum  spear but his rubber body isn't all for  offense it gives him a ton of mobility  in being able to reach high or far away  points which can be combined with gum  gum rocket to send him flying anywhere  he needs to go he can also use gum gum  ufo which kind of lets him float for a  bit of time the fruit also gives him  some protection with options like gum  gum balloon or by treating himself like  a trampoline or tarp that springs things  like cannonballs people or bullets off  of himself luffy can also bump up his  abilities by using his gear forms gear  second has him pumping the blood and  oxygen through his body faster something  that makes himself much faster and  stronger as a result this also opens up  the jet series of attacks which are more  or less upgrades of his usual stuff add  in hockey and you have the hawk eagle  and rock series of attacks as well gear  third has him blowing into his thumbs to  inflate his bones and allow him to  create giant punches kicks or whatever  else he might need here you have attacks  given the giant title and just like in  gear second when you add in haki you get  some animal named attacks like elephant  gun and grizzly magnum something kind of  fun between the first three forms as  well is that each of them has a  different elemental based attack water  luffy appears when he's in his normal  form the fiery red hawk is his second  gear ability and the electrified thor  elephant gun shows up in gear third it's  nothing super important but it is kind  of a cute theming structure that shows  up onto fourth gear along with three new  forms bound man focuses on elastic  compression and release to give a  massive boost to luffy's attacks his  range is shorter but to make up for that  he can basically fly and he hits hard  enough to even take out doflamingo when  using