though  it's instead his ability to be a  shipwright carpenter and mechanic he  keeps the sunny in top shape produces  weapons and repairs or creates whatever  the crew needs and we saw what happened  to mary so we know how vital his role is  especially in the new world while we've  seen him do some fantastic and amazing  things there is one that always stood  out to me as being hilarious and  literally above the rest frankie skywalk  was basically the moment that frankie  created fortnite as he made stairs right  into the sky to fight orbs we also see  him building bridges in that arc using  debris to make giant nunchucks and again  frankie just shows off that he is very  versatile and takes advantage of  anything in his surroundings he's a  character that creates opportunities and  allows his crew to not just perform to  their own potential but by creating what  they need in any given moment he also  allows them to rise above their  potential and succeed where they might  otherwise fail member number nine is the  soul king himself brooke brooke was part  of the rumbar pirates 52 years ago but  the entire group was wiped out when they  were stranded in the florian triangle  this including brook however he had  hidden the yomi yominomi which gave him  a second chance at life  unfortunately though when his soul was  looking for his body after coming back  it was unable to do so because it was  still lost in the triangle by the time  brook's soul found his body all that was  left was a skeleton even so the soul was  able to reanimate the body leaving brook  as a walking talking skeleton while  first seeming useless other than the  extra life brook eventually learns to  manipulate his own soul allowing it to  leave his body and to become a ghost he  can move through walls as well as sneak  into areas that might be unavailable  otherwise this control over his soul  also extends to things housing weaker  souls like homies lastly brook can  harness the chill of the underworld  allowing him to freeze things with his  sword or his aura and speaking of his  sword brook is the crew's second  swordsman he uses a cane sword called  soul solid and while zoro is more of a  samurai fighter brook uses a mixture of  fencing and the ido that he calls gentle  blade style his attacks tend to be much  more precise and speedy offering a lot  of power as a result beyond his  swordsmanship though brook has some  unique abilities to his skeletal body he  is so lightweight that he can run on  water kind of circumventing the weakness  to water that devil fruit users have  he's also resistant to heat cold  lightning and disease as he doesn't have  skin blood or organs he can survive  having his head cut off and he can just  heal from drinking milk when i think of  how strong brooke is in terms of the  crew i usually think of him as kind of  middle of the group somewhere just below  frankie and around usa and just like  with those characters while he  definitely offers a little bit of power  he has a secondary skill set that is  pretty invaluable and that is because  brooke is our cruise musician he  specializes in violin piano and guitar  but regardless of what he's playing he  can enchant his melodies to have effects  on those who hear them for example  making people fall asleep or hypnotizing  them into thinking that they're at some  kind of festival which if you can affect  an enemy with these things is pretty  valuable brook also has the role of  being in charge of keeping up morale on  the crew he uses music to lighten the  mood inspire or just generally cheer  people up you've probably gone in long  car rides you know how much music helps  but imagine days at sea with nothing  else to do and nothing to listen to i  would think it could be rough at times  even without the music brook's sense of  humor and larger than life personality  really help with raising the mood in  general and while not all of his jokes  might land we could probably do without  the 500th panty joke on average i'd say  the crew is extremely lucky to have him  with them and now on to our 10th and  final official crew member jinbei  was a former warlord and is now the  helmsman of the straw hats ever since on  fishman island jinbe has always kind of  felt like a character you meet in an rpg  who is way higher level than your party  but that you know you will eventually be  able to recruit and that's kind of  exactly what happens with him when luffy  meets jinbe he is a considerable  powerhouse definitely not able to take  on the admirals but even against them he  can kinda hold his own and protect  himself for the most part we even see  him taking the attack that killed ace  fairly well  not great but you know he survived we  see him standing toe to toe with moria  easily basically taking him down in one  shot and even big mom states that jinbe  leaving her crew would be a huge loss of  power for her jinbe is easily one of the  strongest fish men to appear in the  series so far even able to punch  wadatsumi into the air he's durable  enough to go through the baptizing and  impel down without flinching something  that the guards claim to be amazing  later taking a head-on sword swing from  big mom without really being damaged at  all and he's fast enough to keep up with  luffy in gear second even on land and  all of these abilities are significantly  amplified when he's underwater jinbe's  real power though comes from fishman  karate and even among fish men he is  considered a prodigy and a master having  received a black belt as a child jinbe  is so talented at fishman karate that  his punches don't even need to land  instead the water particles in the air  will react to his attack and send  enemies flying  even when we look at something like big  mom's crew we see him taking out the  officer's charlotte opera in one punch  beyond all of this his fishman karate  allows him to freely manipulate water  enabling him to throw it bend it or  shape it through his attacks even just  his water shot which is a basic  technique was miles stronger than hordy  jones's despite hordy being on energy  steroids basically jinbe is a brawler  he's a tank he's fast and he's a water  bender all of which combine to make him  quite a threat as a helmsman jinbe is  able to take advantage of his knowledge  of sea currents and general mastery of  the craft to allow him to surf the sunny  through a curling wave with frankie even  saying that jinbe would be able to bring  out sunny's full potential and the last  thing i want to mention with jinbei is  something that probably goes a bit  underappreciated and that's his ability  to speak a voice of reason jinbe is  level-headed tactful and  well-thought-out most importantly though  is his ability to translate those  thoughts and feelings towards others  especially on a diplomatic scale like he  had done with big mom or on an emotional  scale like he did with luffy after ace's  death and while characters like robin  nami zorro and to a lesser degree  frankie if he's in the mood to be  serious  might be able to do this kind of thing  as well jinbe's words seem to inherently  carry more weight to many people  worldwide luffy included now i do want  to quickly mention the two people who  literally carry the crew on their backs  as well because the mary and the sunny  are absolutely crewmates in their own  right the going mary was a caravel ship  one popular in the 15th century in our  world that offered a lot of  maneuverability and was small enough to  travel through rivers easily which are  great things but this lightweight design  also means  it's kind of fragile which we definitely  see with the mary we got the mary in  syrup village and she carried the crew  all the way to water 7 and annie's lobby  before she was finally put to rest the  merry was a very basic ship a few  cannons a lounge a room for the men and  one for the women and a storage room of  course we also saw her being given wings  going towards skypia as well but while  the mary didn't offer anything crazy  like the sunny wood it was a ship that  was loved by her crew and that loved  them back  so much so that a club outermon or ship  fairy appeared basically a sign that the  ship had been genuinely cared for we see  the cleveland appearing in both skypia  to repair the mary as well as bringing  the ship to annie's lobby to rescue the  crew and carry them one last time mary  was a simple ship but her crew was  reckless with her luffy crashed her into  icebergs zorro and sanji were stupid and  broke things all the time  but even so she was happy mary was  succeeded by the thousand sunny a ship  designed by frankie to be the greatest  ship in the world  unlike the mary which was a caraval the  sunny is a brigantine and this ship has  all the bells and whistles most  iconically is the soldier docking system  which houses compartments for the  soldiers of the sunny as frankie calls  them channel 0 has paddles on either  side of the ship allowing them to  progress even without wind or even  travel in reverse if needed channel 1  has a remodeled waiver channel 2 has the  mini mary a shopping boat channel 3 has  a submarine that looks like a shark the  shark submerged 3.  channel 4 has the black rhino channel 5  has the brachio tank and naturally  channel 6 has an inflatable pool just  like frankie himself the sunny can also  release a burst of air the coup de burst  a massive force that allows the sunny to  fly for a decent distance basically  allowing them to escape in a worst case  scenario the head of the sunny also has  some secrets as well chicken voyage sees  the mane of the lion becoming a  propeller that pushes the ship backwards  or the geon cannon which has the lion  opening its mouth and firing a massive  energy beam on the less battle oriented  side of things the sunny also has a boys  and a girls room but it also has a  kitchen a sick bay an aquarium a library  the usop factory frankie's workshop and  a crow's nest the main level also has a  garden for usopp's pop greens an area  for nami's tangerine grove and a flower  bed for robin the sunny is just an  all-around upgrade to the mary it offers  literally anything that the crew might  need and if it doesn't have something  frankie is able to add it and that leads  us to the last topic of this video the  honorary straw hat and best girl in the  series  vivi while not able to join the crew  because you know she's a princess and  whatnot vivi was made an honorary member  of the crew she began as miss wednesday  working for baroque works in order to  find out the true identity of mr zero  crocodile however once the straw hats  uncovered that she is actually princess  vivi nefertari she drops that disguise  pretty quickly phoebe can sometimes have  a pretty naive view of the world  expecting to be able to save everyone  and unable to accept that there would be  loss of any kind before she could  succeed she could be a little bit  entitled from time to time and she often  butted heads with luffy when it came to  making plans  but she genuinely cared about everyone  especially the straw hats for example  choosing to stop and find a doctor for  nami before going to alabasta to save  her people she has an amazing sense of  duty both to her country and to her  friends and in general is just a  genuinely good person similar to jinbe  she also has a very reasonable and  diplomatic view of the world  understanding that violence and pride  aren't always the answer for every  problem and that sometimes you're going  to need to bow your head if you want to  move forward despite that though vivi  was also not useless on the battlefield  she wasn't exactly the strongest  character and i doubt she progressed in  the same way as the rest of the crew  since she was left as princess but she  did manage to hold her own enough to  become a single-digit agent for baroque  works while she doesn't have much power  behind her attacks she's extremely agile  she's honestly pretty similar to nami  before she had access to weather  abilities rather than using a bose staff  like nami did though vivi used the  peacock slashers sharp bladed discs on a  wire that spun around her fingers and  were absolutely able to decapitate  someone if needed or if an enemy was too  strong or too fast for her she could  always try to stun her opponents with a  hypnotic dance using the patterns on her  clothes or her perfume scent in the  anime like i said vivi doesn't offer  much in terms of power but her  diplomatic skills as well as her ability  to win people over are worth just as  much in the right situation especially  when we consider the events of revelry  oh and also she has a pet duck and karu  is fantastic and what more do you really  need but there you have it a quick look  at all the straw hats how they fight and  what they offer the crew on a grander  scale some are more battle oriented some  are more support oriented but each  member of the crew brings with them a  talent that is necessary for the crew's  success which roommate is your favorite  and why and out of all the crew members  which one has your favorite attack skill  or ability finally if you were to join  the crew what would you bring to the  table let me know all those in the  comments down below and of course  remember to leave a like to let us know  to keep making one piece content you can  also subscribe to the channel which is a  totally free way of supporting us and  keeps you up to date on all anime uproar  content finally you can follow us over  on twitter at anime uproar or you can  follow myself over on my own channel  axel beats for now though thank you all  so much for watching and until next time  remember to stay excellent
 

